			"200": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "1024 slots = 16 types x 64. Per-slot random values (hash of Perlin), per-type weights: wind, fall, size, tumble, twinkle, align-to-motion. Velocity = (wind + fall + sway + eddy) x depth x speed variation. Eddy: one at a time from the Clock, random centre, small and large in turn, swirls items around its centre and lifts them; the Delay before Base Velocity breaks the loop through Position."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 1400,
					"width": 2300,
					"x": 260,
					"y": 1640
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
