						"value": "Glyphs: one small white texture per type, rendered once at 1/4 patch size, tinted per slot. Order: Leaf, Bowler, Star, Twig, Cap, Heart, Maple Seed, Chestnut, Feather, Note, Snowflake, Confetti, Bubble, Paper Plane, Raindrop, Newspaper."
					}
